{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-13","level":"B1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Einkaufen 3","bn":"কেনাকাটা ৩"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"Darf ich die Hose ___? (চেষ্টা করে দেখা)","answers":["anprobieren"],"options":["anprobieren","auspacken","abbuchen"],"promptBn":"darf + infinitive","id":"b1-practice-13-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die Firma ___ das Sofa morgen. (সরবরাহ করা)","answers":["liefert"],"options":["liefert","liefern","liefere"],"promptBn":"die Firma → -t","id":"b1-practice-13-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich ___ die Zeitung online. (সাবস্ক্রাইব করা)","answers":["abonniere"],"options":["abonniere","abonniert","abonnieren"],"promptBn":"ich → -e","id":"b1-practice-13-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die Bank ___ das Geld jeden Monat ab. (ডেবিট করা)","answers":["bucht"],"options":["bucht","buchen","buche"],"promptBn":"abbuchen: bucht … ab","id":"b1-practice-13-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich ___ das Paket aus. (খোলা)","answers":["packe"],"options":["packe","packt","packen"],"promptBn":"auspacken: ich → packe … aus","id":"b1-practice-13-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Können Sie mir das bitte ___? (ব্যাখ্যা করা)","answers":["erklären"],"options":["erklären","erklärt","erkläre"],"promptBn":"können + infinitive","id":"b1-practice-13-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wir ___ den Urlaub am Meer. (উপভোগ করা)","answers":["genießen"],"options":["genießen","genießt","genieße"],"promptBn":"wir → infinitive-এর রূপ","id":"b1-practice-13-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich möchte ___, wann der Kurs beginnt. (খুঁজে বের করা)","answers":["herausfinden"],"options":["herausfinden","testen","liefern"],"promptBn":"möchte + infinitive","id":"b1-practice-13-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich nehme die Quittung mit, ___ ich die Jacke umtauschen kann. (যাতে)","answers":["damit"],"options":["damit","obwohl","seitdem"],"promptBn":"যাতে","id":"b1-practice-13-q9"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich spare, damit wir im Sommer in Urlaub fahren ___.","answers":["können"],"options":["kön